  "description": "The proposal comprises a 6.0 metre rear extension at ground floor level. The property currently benefits from an existing 3.0 metre rear extension with a flat roof, which will be incorporated into the proposed enlarged extension. Maximum height 3.0m from natural ground floor level and eaves height is 2.75. No alterations are proposed to the front elevation of the property. The development will include: Brick and block cavity walls to match the existing property. New uPVC double-glazed doors and windows to match the existing. A high-quality felt roof finish, Two rooflights, A maximum projection of 150mm above the existing roof plane. All materials and finishes will be in keeping with the existing property.\n",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed erection of single storey rear extension (6.00m in depth, maximum height of 3.00m and eaves height of 2.75m) falls within the parameters of permitted development as set out under Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended)."
